Siri Remote.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-tv-4k-yellow-bg-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-tv-4k-yellow-bg-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17013,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-video-nascosto-macos-tahoe-26-7\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere: il leak arriva da Apple con un video nascosto in macOS Tahoe 26.7\",\"excerpt\":\"Nella Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 compare un breve video nascosto che mostra la Visual Intelligence in funzione su AirPods con fotocamere.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-con-fotocamera-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-con-fotocamera\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16993,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-6-macos-golden-gate-per-sviluppatori\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 6 di macOS Golden Gate per sviluppatori\",\"excerpt\":\"Arriva la sesta beta di macOS Golden Gate: aggiornamento via Software Update, nuove modifiche di design e un’evoluzione di Siri in “Siri AI”, con funzioni legate a Spotlight e Visual Intelligence.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":n